title Asset Link Creation Business Process

actor Prosumer
participant Camunda
participant VPPaaS
participant Kong
participant "AssetLink Service" as Service
participant "Telemetry Service" as Telemetry
participant Kafka

Prosumer->Camunda: Fill Asset Link creation data\n(prosumerID, utilityOperatorID)
Camunda->VPPaaS: Request Asset Link Creation
activate VPPaaS
VPPaaS->VPPaaS: Verify if creation is possible\n(promise: true/false)

alt promise = true
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Promise
  VPPaaS->Kong: POST /AssetLink
  Kong->Service: Forward Create Request
  activate Service
  Service->Database: INSERT AssetLink\n(idProsumer, idUtilityOperator)
  Database-->Service: OK (returns new AssetLink ID)
  Service->Kafka: Create Topic\n(AssetLinkID-UtilityOperatorName)\ne.g. "1-EDP"
  note right of Kafka: Topic name format:\nAssetLinkID-UtilityOperatorName
  Kafka-->Service: Topic created
  Service->Telemetry: Register Topic for Consumption
  activate Telemetry
  Telemetry->Kafka: Subscribe to new topic
  note right of Telemetry: Spawns DynamicTopicConsumer thread
  Kafka-->Telemetry: Subscribed
  Telemetry-->Service: OK
  deactivate Telemetry
  Service-->Kong: Response (assetLinkID)
  deactivate Service
  Kong-->VPPaaS: Response
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Declare (assetLinkID)
  Camunda->Prosumer: Check Asset Link Creation\n(assetLinkID confirmed)
  Prosumer->Camunda: Accept
  Camunda-->VPPaaS: Accept
else promise = false
  VPPaaS-->Camunda: Decline
  Camunda->Prosumer: Decide what to do next\n(retry or abort)
end
deactivate VPPaaS
